  "scope": "Derive proof-word tail level bound directly from a square comparison",
  "validation": "Paired target and sole tracked direct Lean client pass; the client object matches byte-for-byte. Two-object-pinned probes show 83 matching declaration/type/axiom reports and identical global simp and instance censuses. Source-current direct-provider pairs map to prior producer receipts.",
  "limitations": [
    "The original setup failed before elaboration because the empty first module directory hid an imported object. The copied failure record points to its subsequently overwritten log path; the saved failure-log copy matches its recorded log hash.",
    "Provider and package transitive dependencies remain cached; matching direct source/object producers do not establish a fully current-source closure. Census comparisons do not prove equality of proof bodies or all persistent environment extensions.",
    "The single target CPU timing pair was collected under shared load and is not a general performance benchmark. The author records predate the commit; the independent review/audit verify its parent and final sources.",
    "Compiled objects and cached overlays are omitted; their recorded paths and hashes require external objects for independent byte verification."
  ],
